{"3926670": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mazebreach", "steam_appid": 3926670, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fans of retro maze-chasers will recognize the twisted rules...</strong><br><br> <br>Remember the maze? The dots? The ghosts? <br>This isn’t that game anymore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MAZEBREACH reimagines the iconic arcade nightmare as a full-body VR horror experience where you are Paco Méndez—the last human with the power to fight back against the horrors lurking in the shifting, breathing labyrinth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rules are twisted, but familiar:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The &quot;dots&quot; are now cursed artifacts—glowing blue spheres humming with dark energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The &quot;ghosts&quot; are something far worse—malformed entities that learn from your movements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The &quot;power pellets&quot;? That’s your hand—a weaponized relic capable of destroying them… if you time it right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ True VR Terror – Feel every heartbeat as the walls close in around you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Strategic Survival – Outsmart enemies that adapt to your playstyle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Classic mechanics reimagined as psychological horror</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Unlock the Truth – Discover why you were chosen to wield this power</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The maze remembers. The maze waits. The maze HUNGERS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DARE TO PLAY WHEN MAZEBREACH HITS VR THIS YEAR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WARNING: This experience may cause:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Elevated heart rate</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Uncontrollable flinching at blue lights</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Permanent distrust of power pellets <br> </p>", "abou